lexei Gogolev","x":"Just wondering what drove that decision to lower the guidance?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q3","e":"csgp","d":"2024-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"Rightmove has already publicly suggested it will increase prices by 35% in the next couple of years, and that follows a track record of years of price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q3","e":"csgp","d":"2024-10-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Lown","x":"Apartments.com third quarter revenue growth came in at 16%, and we are maintaining our full year guidance of 17% revenue growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q4","e":"csgp","d":"2025-02-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"In 2025, we expect to deliver 13 billion impressions across TV, streaming video, podcasts, social media and influencers, direct digital paid search and display.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q4","e":"csgp","d":"2025-02-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"In 2024, we ran more than 47,000 commercials, including spots and high profile media like the Olympics, the World Series, College Football, the NFL, the Grammys, the Emmys and across primetime TV and streaming video like Netflix, Disney, Paramount, YouTube and ESPN.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q4","e":"csgp","d":"2025-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"We have begun renewing contracts on this basis and for the first cohort of contracts that received price increases, 98% have renewed at the significant price list.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2024 Q4","e":"csgp","d":"2025-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Lown","x":"There clearly will be more of a unit increase over the next year versus price increase.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2025-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"This, combined with other identified cost savings resulted in 50% year-over-year EBITDA growth for the combined brands.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2025-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"In the first quarter, we realized over $50 million in annualized savings, mostly through cost reduction initiatives in our Homes.com investment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2025-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christian Lown","x":"We are increasing our guidance expectations for 2Q for 2025 and now expect revenue growth of 7% to 8% for the full year as growth accelerates throughout the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q2","e":"csgp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"Streaming video grew by 25%, paid social by 13%, and digital by 130% compared to Q2 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/costar-csgp-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q2","e":"csgp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"Additionally, we expanded digital and streaming sponsorships with DraftKings and Roku, and audio and podcasting partnerships with Spotify and Amazon Music.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/costar-csgp-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2025 Q2","e":"csgp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Tomasello",