call-transcripts/2025/10/28/costar-csgp-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"Put plainly, when consumers experience Homes AI, they spend roughly four times longer than they do on conventional residential search.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/costar-csgp-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"This is precisely the dynamic that precedes meaningful consumer share shift and is exactly the proof point we expected our AI investment to produce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/costar-csgp-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Lown","x":"The outperformance in adjusted EBITDA was primarily due to lower personnel costs and cost-saving efforts as we continue to find efficiencies from AI, personnel, and other expense initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/costar-csgp-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q1","e":"csgp","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christian Lown","x":"First, as you heard from our comments, we reaffirmed our guidance range for revenue and increased our EBITDA guidance, so broadly in line with what we are looking for from a bookings perspective and from a revenue development perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/costar-csgp-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q3","e":"csgp","d":"2026-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"We are integrating acquisitions that we think will create a lot of value, and we're investing aggressively in AI, and I think successfully.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/costar-csgp-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q3","e":"csgp","d":"2026-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Florance","x":"So you'll have that relationship between the owner, the owner group, and the property manager, where the owner group is looking for cost savings aggressively, and the property manager is trying to figure out how to achieve that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/costar-csgp-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CSGP 2026 Q3","e":"csgp","d":"2026-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Stephen Sheldon","x":"On the cost savings, can you just give some more detail on the $200 million that you are expecting to realize next year, some of the bigger components of that, and whether some could be reinvested?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/costar-csgp-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[41,1,11204,0,0,0,9453,1437],[42,1,12185,0,0,0,10981,777],[43,1,13540,0,0,0,11823,1290],[44,1,12849,0,0,0,11619,932],[45,1,11145,0,0,0,9741,1090],[46,1,11120,0,0,0,9510,1230],[47,1,12200,0,0,0,10594,1295],[48,1,12146,0,0,0,10520,1208],[49,1,2512,0,0,0,1601,622],[50,1,9465,0,0,0,8018,1084],[51,1,8715,0,0,0,7317,1062],[52,1,11657,0,0,0,9737,1309],[53,1,9120,0,0,0,7514,1207],[54,1,8672,0,0,0,7402,916],[56,1,10950,0,0,0,9546,1048],[57,1,11098,0,0,0,9729,957],[58,1,9250,0,0,0,7438,1421],[59,1,9416,0,0,0,8114,999],[60,1,9447,0,0,0,8086,1074],[61,1,9832,0,0,0,8621,956],[62,1,8647,0,0,0,7623,458],[63,1,9253,0,0,0,8410,449],[65,1,8538,0,0,0,7413,790],[67,1,11360,0,0,0,9585,1248]],"cinema":[[41,1,11204,0,0,0,9453,1437],[42,1,12185,0,0,0,10981,777],[43,1,13540,0,0,0,11823,1290],[44,1,12849,0,0,0,11619,932],[45,1,11145,0,0,0,9741,1090],[46,1,11120,0,0,0,9510,1230],[47,1,12200,0,0,0,10594,1295],[48,1,12146,0,0,0,10520,1208],[49,1,2512,0,0,0,1601,622],[50,1,9465,0,0,0,8018,1084],[51,1,8715,0,0,0,7317,1062],[52,1,11657,0,0,0,9737,1309],[53,1,9120,0,0,0,7514,1207],[54,1,8672